  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is Lily. Lily is a girl. She is happy. Lily has a new bag. Her bag is red. This is Lily's mom. This is Lily's dad. Mom and Dad are happy. They go to a new place. This place is a new city. It is a big city. This new city is far. They go in a plane.",
      "This plane is big. The plane is white. It flies up. Lily is in the plane. She looks out. She sees the sky. The sky is blue. Very blue. Lily is happy. She sees a city down. The city is very small from up. This is a new city. A big, new city.",
      "The plane stops. Lily is out. She is in the new city. The city is big. Lily sees new houses. She sees green trees. She sees a park. This new place is fun. Lily likes this new place. Mom likes this new place. Dad likes this new place. All are very happy. This new city is good."
    ],
